---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | txttocsv"
  description="How txttocsv handles data. Files are processed in your browser and never uploaded. Read how cookies, analytics and third-party advertising such as Google AdSense are used."
  noindex={false}
>
  <article class="wrap section article">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span>Privacy</span></nav>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated on {updated}</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      The files you convert on this site are processed entirely in your browser. They are never uploaded
      to, seen by, or stored on our servers. We do use cookies and third-party services for analytics and
      advertising, described below.
    </p>

    <h2>Files and conversions</h2>
    <p>
      The TXT and CSV converters run as JavaScript on your device. The text you paste or the file you drop
      in stays local. We have no access to it and keep no copy of it.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site displays ads served by Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies
      to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and other sites.</li>
      <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can review Google's advertising practices in the <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Privacy &amp; Terms</a>.</li>
      <li>For opting out of third-party vendor cookies, see <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use privacy-focused analytics to understand which pages are useful. This records aggregate,
      non-identifying information such as page views and referring sites.
      <em>(Confirm your chosen provider here, for example Plausible or Google Analytics 4, and list it.)</em>
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services we rely on</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Google AdSense: advertising.</li>
      <li>Your analytics provider: aggregate traffic measurement.</li>
      <li>Your hosting provider (for example Vercel or Cloudflare Pages): serving the website.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of any
      personal data a service holds about you, and to object to personalised advertising. Because we do not
      collect personal data directly, most requests should be directed to the relevant third party above.
      For anything else, contact <a href="mailto:info@txttocsv.com">info@txttocsv.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      If you are in a region that requires it, a consent banner will ask permission before non-essential
      cookies are set. You can withdraw consent at any time through your browser settings.
    </p>

    <p class="muted"><em>This template covers the essentials required for advertising and analytics.
    Have it reviewed against the exact laws of your operating jurisdiction before launch.</em></p>
  </article>
</Base>
